<view
  bindtap="{{d}}"
  catchtouchmove="{{c}}"
  class="_div holding-ratio-modal data-v-a7cabce2"
  wx:if="{{a}}"
>
  <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__sheet data-v-a7cabce2">
    <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__header data-v-a7cabce2">
      <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__header-bar data-v-a7cabce2">
        <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__header-inner data-v-a7cabce2">
          <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__title data-v-a7cabce2"
            >国家队持仓比例</view
          >
          <image
            alt="极简版图标"
            catchtap="{{b}}"
            class="_img holding-ratio-modal__close-btn data-v-a7cabce2"
            src="https://st.gtimg.com/pcm/mpuvkgsn_f3154aec0ea2fe2eb772304181644cda.svg"
          ></image>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__content data-v-a7cabce2">
      <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__description data-v-a7cabce2"
        >指ETF前十大持有人中，中央汇金、证金公司、社保基金、养老保险基金、国新投资等国资背景机构（即"国家队"）所持份额，合计占基金总份额的比例。</view
      >
    </view>
    <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__footer data-v-a7cabce2">
      <view class="_div holding-ratio-modal__footer-text data-v-a7cabce2"
        >数据来自基金中报/年报，每半年披露一次。</view
      >
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
